<description>&lt;p&gt;ISIS attacked an internal security site in Hasakah, killing two Syrian security force members. Separate armed attacks in Deir ez-Zor and Daraa killed additional Syrian security personnel, and a drone strike in Suwayda wounded four security personnel. Qatar and Canada reaffirmed support for Syria’s recovery and Palestinian rights. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE9zZWhzX3JnN0lod3RuWVhhSzZqRlZ5U2ttWEl2b0UtSzV0QVNjWGMzMVFsbzEtOTFYQjdxNG1EVmpvRVFRNDk1TlEtOEw0S0R4ZU1IMGZ0ck15MU55c1ZqakFvazFJdTlZSURpdmNUWnlwemFVY3BIMkpweXh3WnM?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPVUFWemNRM0NUVGZ3Mk85bUdjc29RZHJQdTE4NjhnZGFZSFp0VTVmZjluTGgxLUM0WUIwV1BTUTltZGV6Smo4WVNEczBfbE0zVEdqejFhZ2JqVmZtZ3NrWnRJRk5ORGxadkQ1UFlubWdTWHRpdVF1NUliZ09zb0h5T2VqLXFKRVZRNzI4cU13?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPZ0xqbkphN2dXZHRzQkVUT2RsWjJMcXhMLW1SRzc5S3dPQ3N6S0c4WTEycnRlVi13T01ZVUlESks4dHFzeTRGMXk4cTJyMExGR3dkZFZIMXo3dGNTSVVIeTVHb0tCdnQ4eTZKTHNnSmhUS0VOZU9rMjhVYXNkNHNEVHBuSGpuTWw5Mm5yNFljZldmRmY3cjBoUlhOZndIZlVFLTJUeW9OZm9GQncwRE42Sg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPRkxDeW5NSTl0eHdxM0hmSVNJVWppbmxyS0cydXBZU1BWOWJxcW9Ka05pSm5uS0hmN2NwV2sxR0Jaa3lDTGx2TUpmU2NjeVNsYnYzcHp5UUE1V1FiZVBXSDB5dmJKUkdOekZRS0p2OURnLXBta2tQdE9oaFFDcXhienJpMzR1b2JVREF5ZHYyNTNDVlBkS0J2c0NfTzNFNDBjWGpFSFJOQ1NEWVlHeDlWa3JUZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNczE5QUdvUXpCU3UyQnMwaGxSVEpEbEhRNWdtOTNHNjg0cWNvczk2a1hwbFVVUUN6dlRpbkc3YV9XU0pEVm1MTlh0VkQ4dXZxMEdIa3pUNEUyZzhkOHZ3N0tR